sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as LLM
  participant F as .pie/plugins/
  participant R as Runtime
  participant P as Plugins
  participant C as Config log
  participant H as PluginHost
  M->>F: read / edit / write (e.g. web/shell.html)
  Note over R: before the next model call
  R->>P: sync(session)
  P->>F: did the folder change?
  P->>P: import + setup of the changed plugins in a throwaway composition
  alt any of them fails
    P-->>R: «NOT applied» + errors
  else all of them load
    P->>C: plugins/snapshot {files, hash, reason}
    P->>H: replace (new Scope, closes the old one)
    P-->>R: «applied» + snapshot number
  end
  R->>R: notice event in the session
  R->>M: model request with the notice as a message and the new tools
  Note over R: if Pie crashes twice at startup, the supervisor restores the last good snapshot
